  "bodyRes": "how_to_play_step5_body",
  "body": "Nails force a slowdown. At speed, only the three hardest-braking moves remain. If you are slow, you are not forced to stop, but you cannot accelerate.",
  "notes": "Eight-frame walkthrough of nails, following GameEngine.nailAllowedSet: a move whose path touches the nails limits the *next* move to a slow-down. At speed above one that is the three candidates nearest the car (the smallest resulting speed); at speed one it is stopping, rolling straight on, or moving to either side.\n\nBoth restricted sets are centred on the coast point, not on the car.",
